  "gear": "La Sportiva Cyklon",
  "description": "Picked up a Talon at the Longs trailhead with perfect timing. Not a particularly fast transition but he was patient. Plenty of snow up top already, socked in on the Trough and patchy snow/ice on the Narrows and Homestretch. Very glad to have microspikes. Speaking of microspikes, Talon volunteered ours to two old mountain women on the way down (Talon is a better person than me). Maiden voyage on the La Sportiva Cyklons. Way better fit for my foot than the Scarpa Rapids and I really like them. Ran down from the Boulder Field and it was really pleasant. 11k foot day!",
  "stravaUrl": "https://www.strava.com/activities/9869993261",
